{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_console_roadmap_developer_console", "label": "Developer console (/console)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_consolelayout", "label": "ConsoleLayout (auth branches + left rail)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Owns every auth branch so sub-pages carry no auth logic; borrows DocsLayout's shape outright so console and /docs read as one product, and caps no width because a layout legislating width forces the next wide page to fight it."}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_walletbalance", "label": "WalletBalance card", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sits outside <nav> because it is account state, not navigation; renders nothing on 403 rather than an empty card, and stays visible at every width because a balance behind a hamburger is not the always-visible one Eloka has."}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_wallet_balance_cache", "label": "Module-scope wallet-balance cache", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AnimatedRoutes remounts the card on every console navigation, so per-mount state meant a refetch and a Loading flash each hop and a cooldown a user could walk past. Only settled answers cache; AuthProvider clears it whenever the session goes anon so the next signer-in cannot see the previous balance."}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_wallet_balance_backend", "label": "GET /wallet/balance BFF route (interaction 9)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Identity is re-derived from the session claim's mobile via the 151 profile on every call, never read from the request, so one developer cannot read another's wallet. 403 (ineligible) and 502 (upstream failure) stay distinct so a transient failure never permanently retires a real balance."}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_my_profile", "label": "My Profile page (/console/profile)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Issues no request of its own \u2014 reads the MeView the layout already fetched. Profile completeness uses onboarding progress rather than Eloka's field checklist, whose own count treats an absent key as complete."}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_profile_detail_blocks", "label": "PROFILE_DETAIL_BLOCKS allowlist", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An allowlist, not a passthrough: whatever lands there is readable by anything running in the page, so a block upstream adds later must be reviewed before it ships."}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_session_cache", "label": "sessionStorage /me session cache", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hydrated in an effect, never in the useState initializer, because prerendered HTML is built with status loading and a synchronous read would trip a hydration mismatch. Display data only \u2014 every request still carries the session cookie."}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_api_keys_management", "label": "API keys management (blocked on issuance contract)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The core reason a developer logs in, but blocked on the Eko credential-issuance API contract; the Credentials page ships a production empty state with no request button until it lands."}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_environment_toggle", "label": "UAT/Production environment toggle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_audit_log", "label": "Console audit log (planned)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_console_roadmap_sandbox_playground", "label": "Console sandbox / API playground (planned)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Today it lives only in /docs behind a CORS proxy; the console should own it, pre-authenticated with the developer's UAT key."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_console_roadmap_developer_console", "target": "docs_console_roadmap_consolelayout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_consolelayout", "target": "docs_developer_docs_layout_ssg_theming_docslayout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_consolelayout", "target": "docs_console_roadmap_walletbalance", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_walletbalance", "target": "docs_console_roadmap_wallet_balance_cache", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_walletbalance", "target": "docs_console_roadmap_wallet_balance_backend", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_consolelayout", "target": "docs_console_roadmap_my_profile", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_my_profile", "target": "docs_console_roadmap_profile_detail_blocks", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_consolelayout", "target": "docs_console_roadmap_session_cache", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_developer_console", "target": "docs_features_business_dashboard_business_dashboard", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_api_keys_management", "target": "docs_ai_native_gap_analysis_ai_native_definition", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "AMBIGUOUS", "confidence_score": 0.2, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_sandbox_playground", "target": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_try_it_console", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_wallet_balance_cache", "target": "docs_features_business_dashboard_caching", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_console_roadmap_session_cache", "target": "docs_developer_docs_layout_ssg_theming_docs_dark_theme", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/console-roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}